        /// are accounted for in the wrapping operations.
        /// Since, for the positive integers, all common
        /// definitions of division are equal, this
        /// is exactly equal to \`self.wrapping_div(rhs)\`.
        ///
        /// # Examples
        ///
        /// Basic usage:
        ///
        /// \`\`\`
