/// Returns:
///
/// * \`1\` - if the specified bits are all zeros,
/// * \`0\` - otherwise.
///
/// [Intel's documentation](https://software.intel.com/sites/landingpage/IntrinsicsGuide/#text=_mm_testz_si128)
