/// Converts packed single-precision (32-bit) floating-point elements in \`a\`
/// to packed 32-bit integers.
///
/// [Intel's documentation](https://software.intel.com/sites/landingpage/IntrinsicsGuide/#text=_mm256_cvtps_epi32)
